    "Name": "Catapult CPLT-R5",
    "Details": "With great effort, RISC Engineers upgraded the Catapult II chassis to an Omnimech level of technology. Employing the most advanced equipment at their disposal, this venerable design's weight was reduced to 55 tons without sacrificing any firepower. The -R5 Configuration is a midrange brawler, sporting two devastating heavy PPCs supported by clan-style pulse lasers.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Experimental TC</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.11</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
